["<aside class=\"callout why\" role=\"note\"><div class=\"callout-t\">Why it matters</div><p>Most missed birds are missed behind. A smooth mount and a swing that never stops fix most of them.</p></aside><figure class=\"diagram\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 400 300\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Your eye is the rear sight. Eye high above the rib: the gun shoots high. Eye flat on the rib, you see a little rib: about right for most guns. Eye low, behind the receiver: the gun shoots low.\">\n<rect width=\"400\" height=\"300\" fill=\"#EEF1EA\"/>\n<text x=\"20\" y=\"28\" font-size=\"18\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#1F3D2B\">Your eye is the rear sight</text>\n<rect x=\"120\" y=\"76\" width=\"250\" height=\"10\" fill=\"#3b4045\"/>\n<line x1=\"120\" y1=\"75\" x2=\"370\" y2=\"75\" stroke=\"#a7aeb3\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n<circle cx=\"366\" cy=\"72\" r=\"4\" fill=\"#ffffff\" stroke=\"#17201A\"/>\n<ellipse cx=\"100\" cy=\"60\" rx=\"13\" ry=\"8\" fill=\"#ffffff\" stroke=\"#17201A\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><circle cx=\"104\" cy=\"60\" r=\"4\" fill=\"#17201A\"/>\n<line x1=\"108\" y1=\"60\" x2=\"366\" y2=\"72\" stroke=\"#FF6A13\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-dasharray=\"5 4\"/>\n<text x=\"20.0\" y=\"116.0\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#FF6A13\" text-anchor=\"start\">Eye high: shoots high</text>\n<rect x=\"120\" y=\"148\" width=\"250\" height=\"10\" fill=\"#3b4045\"/>\n<line x1=\"120\" y1=\"147\" x2=\"370\" y2=\"147\" stroke=\"#a7aeb3\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n<circle cx=\"366\" cy=\"144\" r=\"4\" fill=\"#ffffff\" stroke=\"#17201A\"/>\n<ellipse cx=\"100\" cy=\"143\" rx=\"13\" ry=\"8\" fill=\"#ffffff\" stroke=\"#17201A\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><circle cx=\"104\" cy=\"143\" r=\"4\" fill=\"#17201A\"/>\n<line x1=\"108\" y1=\"143\" x2=\"366\" y2=\"144\" stroke=\"#1F3D2B\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-dasharray=\"5 4\"/>\n<text x=\"20.0\" y=\"188.0\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#1F3D2B\" text-anchor=\"start\">A little rib: about right</text>\n<rect x=\"120\" y=\"220\" width=\"250\" height=\"10\" fill=\"#3b4045\"/>\n<line x1=\"120\" y1=\"219\" x2=\"370\" y2=\"219\" stroke=\"#a7aeb3\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n<circle cx=\"366\" cy=\"216\" r=\"4\" fill=\"#ffffff\" stroke=\"#17201A\"/>\n<ellipse cx=\"100\" cy=\"228\" rx=\"13\" ry=\"8\" fill=\"#ffffff\" stroke=\"#17201A\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><circle cx=\"104\" cy=\"228\" r=\"4\" fill=\"#17201A\"/>\n<line x1=\"108\" y1=\"228\" x2=\"366\" y2=\"216\" stroke=\"#FF6A13\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-dasharray=\"5 4\"/>\n<text x=\"20.0\" y=\"260.0\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#FF6A13\" text-anchor=\"start\">Eye low: shoots low</text>\n<text x=\"200.0\" y=\"290.0\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#1F3D2B\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Fit decides where it shoots. Pattern to check.</text>\n</svg>\n</figure><ul><li>Your eye is the rear sight. Fit decides where the gun shoots <span class=\"cert c-mid\" title=\"Certainty\">85%</span>.</li><li>Both eyes open, eyes on the bird, not the bead <span class=\"cert c-lo\" title=\"Certainty\">70%</span>.</li></ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>More: what the app already covers</summary><ul><li>Stance, the three leads, how much lead, angles and the clay plan: <a href=\"#/s/shotgun-skills/2\">Shotgun skills</a> and <a href=\"#/s/shotgun-mastery/8\">Shotgun mastery</a>.</li><li>Find your dominant eye first: <a href=\"#/s/shotgun-mastery/12\">Shotgun mastery</a>.</li><li>This chapter adds the mount as numbered steps and one picture per lead method.</li><li>Browning: an adjustable comb is set so you look \"directly down the center of the rib with both the front and middle beads in exact alignment\" (95%, Citori manual).</li></ul></details>","<div class=\"steps\" data-n=\"4\"><div class=\"steps-head\"><b>Mount a shotgun in 4 steps</b><span class=\"steps-count\">1 of 4</span></div><div class=\"steps-track\"><figure class=\"step-frame\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 400 300\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Mount step 1: stand with feet about shoulder width, front foot toward where the bird will be, gun low with the butt under the armpit and the muzzle up, safety on.\">\n<rect width=\"400\" height=\"300\" fill=\"#EEF1EA\"/>\n<circle cx=\"24\" cy=\"22\" r=\"15\" fill=\"#1F3D2B\"/><text x=\"24\" y=\"28\" font-size=\"17\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#ffffff\" text-anchor=\"middle\">1</text>\n<text x=\"46\" y=\"28\" font-size=\"18\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#1F3D2B\">Ready: low gun</text>\n<circle cx=\"110\" cy=\"70\" r=\"16\" fill=\"#6b5a45\" stroke=\"#17201A\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/><rect x=\"92\" y=\"56\" width=\"34\" height=\"9\" rx=\"3\" fill=\"#FF6A13\"/><path d=\"M96 86 L124 86 L128 160 L92 160 Z\" fill=\"#1F3D2B\"/><path d=\"M96 160 L80 220 M122 160 L142 220\" stroke=\"#1F3D2B\" stroke-width=\"12\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><line x1=\"94\" y1=\"130\" x2=\"226\" y2=\"60\" stroke=\"#3b4045\" stroke-width=\"7\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><line x1=\"211.1\" y1=\"126.0\" x2=\"106.0\" y2=\"130.0\" stroke=\"#1F3D2B\" stroke-width=\"1.6\"/><circle cx=\"106.0\" cy=\"130.0\" r=\"3\" fill=\"#1F3D2B\"/><rect x=\"211.1\" y=\"103.0\" width=\"157.9\" height=\"23.0\" rx=\"5\" fill=\"#ffffff\" stroke=\"#1F3D2B\" stroke-width=\"1.3\"/><text x=\"290.0\" y=\"120.0\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#17201A\" text-anchor=\"middle\">butt under the arm</text><line x1=\"200.4\" y1=\"225.1\" x2=\"142.0\" y2=\"220.0\" stroke=\"#1F3D2B\" stroke-width=\"1.6\"/><circle cx=\"142.0\" cy=\"220.0\" r=\"3\" fill=\"#1F3D2B\"/><rect x=\"200.4\" y=\"213.0\" width=\"179.3\" height=\"23.0\" rx=\"5\" fill=\"#ffffff\" stroke=\"#1F3D2B\" stroke-width=\"1.3\"/><text x=\"290.0\" y=\"230.0\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#17201A\" text-anchor=\"middle\">front foot to the bird</text>\n<text x=\"200.0\" y=\"290.0\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#1F3D2B\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Safety on until the gun is up.</text>\n</svg>\n<figcaption><b>1.</b> Ready: feet set, low gun, safety on.</figcaption></figure><figure class=\"step-frame\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 400 300\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Mount step 2: lock your eyes on the bird, its head if you can see it, before the gun moves.\">\n<rect width=\"400\" height=\"300\" fill=\"#EEF1EA\"/>\n<circle cx=\"24\" cy=\"22\" r=\"15\" fill=\"#1F3D2B\"/><text x=\"24\" y=\"28\" font-size=\"17\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#ffffff\" text-anchor=\"middle\">2</text>\n<text x=\"46\" y=\"28\" font-size=\"18\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#1F3D2B\">Eyes on the bird</text>\n<circle cx=\"110\" cy=\"70\" r=\"16\" fill=\"#6b5a45\" stroke=\"#17201A\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/><rect x=\"92\" y=\"56\" width=\"34\" height=\"9\" rx=\"3\" fill=\"#FF6A13\"/><path d=\"M96 86 L124 86 L128 160 L92 160 Z\" fill=\"#1F3D2B\"/><path d=\"M96 160 L80 220 M122 160 L142 220\" stroke=\"#1F3D2B\" stroke-width=\"12\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><line x1=\"94\" y1=\"130\" x2=\"226\" y2=\"60\" stroke=\"#3b4045\" stroke-width=\"7\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><g transform=\"translate(330.0 70.0) scale(1.1)\"><ellipse cx=\"0\" cy=\"0\" rx=\"13\" ry=\"5\" fill=\"#17201A\"/><circle cx=\"13\" cy=\"-2\" r=\"4\" fill=\"#17201A\"/><path d=\"M17 -2 l6 1 l-6 2 Z\" fill=\"#17201A\"/><path d=\"M-4 -2 L4 -16 L8 -2 Z\" fill=\"#17201A\"/><path d=\"M-13 0 l-6 -3 l0 6 Z\" fill=\"#17201A\"/></g><line x1=\"122\" y1=\"66\" x2=\"312\" y2=\"70\" stroke=\"#FF6A13\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-dasharray=\"6 5\"/><line x1=\"260.0\" y1=\"104.0\" x2=\"260.0\" y2=\"70.0\" stroke=\"#1F3D2B\" stroke-width=\"1.6\"/><circle cx=\"260.0\" cy=\"70.0\" r=\"3\" fill=\"#1F3D2B\"/><rect x=\"191.8\" y=\"103.0\" width=\"136.5\" height=\"23.0\" rx=\"5\" fill=\"#ffffff\" stroke=\"#1F3D2B\" stroke-width=\"1.3\"/><text x=\"260.0\" y=\"120.0\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#17201A\" text-anchor=\"middle\">eyes on the head</text>\n<text x=\"200.0\" y=\"290.0\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#1F3D2B\" text-anchor=\"middle\">The eyes lead. The gun follows.</text>\n</svg>\n<figcaption><b>2.</b> Eyes lock on the bird's head.</figcaption></figure><figure class=\"step-frame\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 400 300\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Mount step 3: push the muzzle toward the bird as you raise the gun, so the front of the gun points where you look.\">\n<rect width=\"400\" height=\"300\" fill=\"#EEF1EA\"/>\n<circle cx=\"24\" cy=\"22\" r=\"15\" fill=\"#1F3D2B\"/><text x=\"24\" y=\"28\" font-size=\"17\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#ffffff\" text-anchor=\"middle\">3</text>\n<text x=\"46\" y=\"28\" font-size=\"18\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#1F3D2B\">Muzzle to the bird</text>\n<circle cx=\"110\" cy=\"70\" r=\"16\" fill=\"#6b5a45\" stroke=\"#17201A\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/><rect x=\"92\" y=\"56\" width=\"34\" height=\"9\" rx=\"3\" fill=\"#FF6A13\"/><path d=\"M96 86 L124 86 L128 160 L92 160 Z\" fill=\"#1F3D2B\"/><path d=\"M96 160 L80 220 M122 160 L142 220\" stroke=\"#1F3D2B\" stroke-width=\"12\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><line x1=\"96\" y1=\"105\" x2=\"244\" y2=\"79\" stroke=\"#3b4045\" stroke-width=\"7\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><g transform=\"translate(330.0 70.0) scale(1.1)\"><ellipse cx=\"0\" cy=\"0\" rx=\"13\" ry=\"5\" fill=\"#17201A\"/><circle cx=\"13\" cy=\"-2\" r=\"4\" fill=\"#17201A\"/><path d=\"M17 -2 l6 1 l-6 2 Z\" fill=\"#17201A\"/><path d=\"M-4 -2 L4 -16 L8 -2 Z\" fill=\"#17201A\"/><path d=\"M-13 0 l-6 -3 l0 6 Z\" fill=\"#17201A\"/></g><line x1=\"250.0\" y1=\"112.0\" x2=\"293.3\" y2=\"98.1\" stroke=\"#FF6A13\" stroke-width=\"4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><path d=\"M300.0 96.0 L292.7 102.9 L290.1 94.6Z\" fill=\"#FF6A13\"/><line x1=\"280.0\" y1=\"144.0\" x2=\"280.0\" y2=\"104.0\" stroke=\"#1F3D2B\" stroke-width=\"1.6\"/><circle cx=\"280.0\" cy=\"104.0\" r=\"3\" fill=\"#1F3D2B\"/><rect x=\"169.0\" y=\"143.0\" width=\"162.1\" height=\"23.0\" rx=\"5\" fill=\"#ffffff\" stroke=\"#1F3D2B\" stroke-width=\"1.3\"/><text x=\"250.0\" y=\"160.0\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#17201A\" text-anchor=\"middle\">push the muzzle out</text>\n<text x=\"200.0\" y=\"290.0\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#1F3D2B\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Push out, then up.</text>\n</svg>\n<figcaption><b>3.</b> Push the muzzle toward the bird.</figcaption></figure><figure class=\"step-frame\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 400 300\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Mount step 4: bring the stock up to your cheek first, then back into the shoulder pocket. Head stays still: the gun comes to your face.\">\n<rect width=\"400\" height=\"300\" fill=\"#EEF1EA\"/>\n<circle cx=\"24\" cy=\"22\" r=\"15\" fill=\"#1F3D2B\"/><text x=\"24\" y=\"28\" font-size=\"17\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#ffffff\" text-anchor=\"middle\">4</text>\n<text x=\"46\" y=\"28\" font-size=\"18\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#1F3D2B\">Stock to face, then shoulder</text>\n<circle cx=\"110\" cy=\"70\" r=\"16\" fill=\"#6b5a45\" stroke=\"#17201A\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/><rect x=\"92\" y=\"56\" width=\"34\" height=\"9\" rx=\"3\" fill=\"#FF6A13\"/><path d=\"M96 86 L124 86 L128 160 L92 160 Z\" fill=\"#1F3D2B\"/><path d=\"M96 160 L80 220 M122 160 L142 220\" stroke=\"#1F3D2B\" stroke-width=\"12\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><line x1=\"98\" y1=\"80\" x2=\"247\" y2=\"64\" stroke=\"#3b4045\" stroke-width=\"7\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><line x1=\"211.2\" y1=\"144.0\" x2=\"100.0\" y2=\"66.0\" stroke=\"#1F3D2B\" stroke-width=\"1.6\"/><circle cx=\"100.0\" cy=\"66.0\" r=\"3\" fill=\"#1F3D2B\"/><rect x=\"211.2\" y=\"143.0\" width=\"97.5\" height=\"23.0\" rx=\"5\" fill=\"#ffffff\" stroke=\"#1F3D2B\" stroke-width=\"1.3\"/><text x=\"260.0\" y=\"160.0\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#17201A\" text-anchor=\"middle\">cheek first</text><line x1=\"187.6\" y1=\"184.0\" x2=\"100.0\" y2=\"92.0\" stroke=\"#1F3D2B\" stroke-width=\"1.6\"/><circle cx=\"100.0\" cy=\"92.0\" r=\"3\" fill=\"#1F3D2B\"/><rect x=\"187.6\" y=\"183.0\" width=\"144.7\" height=\"23.0\" rx=\"5\" fill=\"#ffffff\" stroke=\"#1F3D2B\" stroke-width=\"1.3\"/><text x=\"260.0\" y=\"200.0\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#17201A\" text-anchor=\"middle\">then the shoulder</text><path d=\"M326 70 L335.3 79.8 L354 58.8\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#1F3D2B\" stroke-width=\"4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/>\n<text x=\"200.0\" y=\"290.0\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#1F3D2B\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Gun to the face, never face to the gun.</text>\n</svg>\n<figcaption><b>4.</b> Stock to the cheek, then the shoulder.</figcaption></figure></div><div class=\"steps-nav\"><button class=\"steps-prev\" aria-label=\"Back\">‹ Back</button><span class=\"steps-dots\"><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i></span><button class=\"steps-next\" aria-label=\"Next\">Next ›</button></div></div><ul><li>Bring the gun to your face, not your face to the gun <span class=\"cert c-mid\" title=\"Certainty\">85%</span>.</li><li>Safety off only as the gun comes up on a bird you will shoot (Tip).</li></ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>More: mount in full</summary><ul><li>Feet about shoulder width, front foot toward the target, knees soft so the hips can turn (85%, hunter education, <a href=\"#/s/shotgun-skills/2\">Shotgun skills</a>).</li><li>Cheek first, then the shoulder; the butt lands on the same spot every time <span class=\"cert c-mid\" title=\"Certainty\">85%</span>.</li><li>Dry practice at home: gun proven empty, no shells in the room, 20 mounts a night (Tip).</li></ul></details>","<figure class=\"diagram\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 400 300\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Pull away: 1 start the muzzle on the bird, 2 match its speed, 3 pull ahead and fire while the gun keeps moving.\">\n<rect width=\"400\" height=\"300\" fill=\"#EEF1EA\"/>\n<text x=\"20\" y=\"28\" font-size=\"18\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#1F3D2B\">Pull away</text>\n<line x1=\"20\" y1=\"90\" x2=\"380\" y2=\"90\" stroke=\"#1F3D2B\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-dasharray=\"4 6\"/>\n<line x1=\"330.0\" y1=\"90.0\" x2=\"373.7\" y2=\"90.0\" stroke=\"#1F3D2B\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><path d=\"M380.0 90.0 L371.9 93.9 L371.9 86.1Z\" fill=\"#1F3D2B\"/>\n<g transform=\"translate(150.0 122.0) scale(1.0)\"><ellipse cx=\"0\" cy=\"0\" rx=\"13\" ry=\"5\" fill=\"#17201A\"/><circle cx=\"13\" cy=\"-2\" r=\"4\" fill=\"#17201A\"/><path d=\"M17 -2 l6 1 l-6 2 Z\" fill=\"#17201A\"/><path d=\"M-4 -2 L4 -16 L8 -2 Z\" fill=\"#17201A\"/><path d=\"M-13 0 l-6 -3 l0 6 Z\" fill=\"#17201A\"/></g>\n<circle cx=\"160\" cy=\"120\" r=\"7\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#1F3D2B\" stroke-width=\"3\"/>\n<circle cx=\"26\" cy=\"120\" r=\"11\" fill=\"#1F3D2B\"/><text x=\"26\" y=\"125.0\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#ffffff\" text-anchor=\"middle\">1</text>\n<text x=\"44.0\" y=\"144.0\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#17201A\" text-anchor=\"start\">Muzzle on the bird</text>\n<g transform=\"translate(210.0 166.0) scale(1.0)\"><ellipse cx=\"0\" cy=\"0\" rx=\"13\" ry=\"5\" fill=\"#17201A\"/><circle cx=\"13\" cy=\"-2\" r=\"4\" fill=\"#17201A\"/><path d=\"M17 -2 l6 1 l-6 2 Z\" fill=\"#17201A\"/><path d=\"M-4 -2 L4 -16 L8 -2 Z\" fill=\"#17201A\"/><path d=\"M-13 0 l-6 -3 l0 6 Z\" fill=\"#17201A\"/></g>\n<circle cx=\"220\" cy=\"164\" r=\"7\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#1F3D2B\" stroke-width=\"3\"/>\n<circle cx=\"26\" cy=\"164\" r=\"11\" fill=\"#1F3D2B\"/><text x=\"26\" y=\"169.0\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#ffffff\" text-anchor=\"middle\">2</text>\n<text x=\"44.0\" y=\"188.0\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#17201A\" text-anchor=\"start\">Match its speed</text>\n<g transform=\"translate(270.0 210.0) scale(1.0)\"><ellipse cx=\"0\" cy=\"0\" rx=\"13\" ry=\"5\" fill=\"#17201A\"/><circle cx=\"13\" cy=\"-2\" r=\"4\" fill=\"#17201A\"/><path d=\"M17 -2 l6 1 l-6 2 Z\" fill=\"#17201A\"/><path d=\"M-4 -2 L4 -16 L8 -2 Z\" fill=\"#17201A\"/><path d=\"M-13 0 l-6 -3 l0 6 Z\" fill=\"#17201A\"/></g>\n<circle cx=\"320\" cy=\"208\" r=\"7\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#FF6A13\" stroke-width=\"3\"/>\n<circle cx=\"26\" cy=\"208\" r=\"11\" fill=\"#FF6A13\"/><text x=\"26\" y=\"213.0\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#ffffff\" text-anchor=\"middle\">3</text>\n<text x=\"44.0\" y=\"232.0\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#FF6A13\" text-anchor=\"start\">Pull ahead: fire, keep moving</text>\n<text x=\"200.0\" y=\"290.0\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#1F3D2B\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Good first method on clays.</text>\n</svg>\n</figure><ul><li>Start on the bird, match it, pull ahead, fire, keep moving <span class=\"cert c-lo\" title=\"Certainty\">70%</span>.</li><li>Easy to learn on clays <span class=\"cert c-lo\" title=\"Certainty\">70%</span>.</li></ul>","<figure class=\"diagram\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 400 300\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Maintained lead: 1 start the muzzle ahead of the bird, 2 hold the same gap as you swing, 3 fire with the gap held and keep swinging.\">\n<rect width=\"400\" height=\"300\" fill=\"#EEF1EA\"/>\n<text x=\"20\" y=\"28\" font-size=\"18\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#1F3D2B\">Maintained lead</text>\n<line x1=\"20\" y1=\"90\" x2=\"380\" y2=\"90\" stroke=\"#1F3D2B\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-dasharray=\"4 6\"/>\n<line x1=\"330.0\" y1=\"90.0\" x2=\"373.7\" y2=\"90.0\" stroke=\"#1F3D2B\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><path d=\"M380.0 90.0 L371.9 93.9 L371.9 86.1Z\" fill=\"#1F3D2B\"/>\n<g transform=\"translate(150.0 122.0) scale(1.0)\"><ellipse cx=\"0\" cy=\"0\" rx=\"13\" ry=\"5\" fill=\"#17201A\"/><circle cx=\"13\" cy=\"-2\" r=\"4\" fill=\"#17201A\"/><path d=\"M17 -2 l6 1 l-6 2 Z\" fill=\"#17201A\"/><path d=\"M-4 -2 L4 -16 L8 -2 Z\" fill=\"#17201A\"/><path d=\"M-13 0 l-6 -3 l0 6 Z\" fill=\"#17201A\"/></g>\n<circle cx=\"210\" cy=\"120\" r=\"7\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#1F3D2B\" stroke-width=\"3\"/>\n<circle cx=\"26\" cy=\"120\" r=\"11\" fill=\"#1F3D2B\"/><text x=\"26\" y=\"125.0\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#ffffff\" text-anchor=\"middle\">1</text>\n<text x=\"44.0\" y=\"144.0\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#17201A\" text-anchor=\"start\">Start ahead of the bird</text>\n<g transform=\"translate(210.0 166.0) scale(1.0)\"><ellipse cx=\"0\" cy=\"0\" rx=\"13\" ry=\"5\" fill=\"#17201A\"/><circle cx=\"13\" cy=\"-2\" r=\"4\" fill=\"#17201A\"/><path d=\"M17 -2 l6 1 l-6 2 Z\" fill=\"#17201A\"/><path d=\"M-4 -2 L4 -16 L8 -2 Z\" fill=\"#17201A\"/><path d=\"M-13 0 l-6 -3 l0 6 Z\" fill=\"#17201A\"/></g>\n<circle cx=\"270\" cy=\"164\" r=\"7\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#1F3D2B\" stroke-width=\"3\"/>\n<circle cx=\"26\" cy=\"164\" r=\"11\" fill=\"#1F3D2B\"/><text x=\"26\" y=\"169.0\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#ffffff\" text-anchor=\"middle\">2</text>\n<text x=\"44.0\" y=\"188.0\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#17201A\" text-anchor=\"start\">Hold the gap</text>\n<g transform=\"translate(270.0 210.0) scale(1.0)\"><ellipse cx=\"0\" cy=\"0\" rx=\"13\" ry=\"5\" fill=\"#17201A\"/><circle cx=\"13\" cy=\"-2\" r=\"4\" fill=\"#17201A\"/><path d=\"M17 -2 l6 1 l-6 2 Z\" fill=\"#17201A\"/><path d=\"M-4 -2 L4 -16 L8 -2 Z\" fill=\"#17201A\"/><path d=\"M-13 0 l-6 -3 l0 6 Z\" fill=\"#17201A\"/></g>\n<circle cx=\"330\" cy=\"208\" r=\"7\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#FF6A13\" stroke-width=\"3\"/>\n<circle cx=\"26\" cy=\"208\" r=\"11\" fill=\"#FF6A13\"/><text x=\"26\" y=\"213.0\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#ffffff\" text-anchor=\"middle\">3</text>\n<text x=\"44.0\" y=\"232.0\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#FF6A13\" text-anchor=\"start\">Fire, keep swinging</text>\n<text x=\"200.0\" y=\"290.0\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#1F3D2B\" text-anchor=\"middle\">For long crossers. Needs practice.</text>\n</svg>\n</figure><ul><li>Start ahead, hold the gap, fire, keep swinging <span class=\"cert c-mid\" title=\"Certainty\">85%</span>.</li><li>Long crossing ducks. Needs practice to judge the gap <span class=\"cert c-mid\" title=\"Certainty\">85%</span>.</li></ul>","<figure class=\"diagram\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 400 300\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Swing through: 1 start the muzzle behind the bird, 2 swing faster than the bird and pass it, 3 fire as the muzzle passes ahead and keep swinging.\">\n<rect width=\"400\" height=\"300\" fill=\"#EEF1EA\"/>\n<text x=\"20\" y=\"28\" font-size=\"18\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#1F3D2B\">Swing through</text>\n<line x1=\"20\" y1=\"90\" x2=\"380\" y2=\"90\" stroke=\"#1F3D2B\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-dasharray=\"4 6\"/>\n<line x1=\"330.0\" y1=\"90.0\" x2=\"373.7\" y2=\"90.0\" stroke=\"#1F3D2B\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><path d=\"M380.0 90.0 L371.9 93.9 L371.9 86.1Z\" fill=\"#1F3D2B\"/>\n<g transform=\"translate(150.0 122.0) scale(1.0)\"><ellipse cx=\"0\" cy=\"0\" rx=\"13\" ry=\"5\" fill=\"#17201A\"/><circle cx=\"13\" cy=\"-2\" r=\"4\" fill=\"#17201A\"/><path d=\"M17 -2 l6 1 l-6 2 Z\" fill=\"#17201A\"/><path d=\"M-4 -2 L4 -16 L8 -2 Z\" fill=\"#17201A\"/><path d=\"M-13 0 l-6 -3 l0 6 Z\" fill=\"#17201A\"/></g>\n<circle cx=\"110\" cy=\"120\" r=\"7\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#1F3D2B\" stroke-width=\"3\"/>\n<circle cx=\"26\" cy=\"120\" r=\"11\" fill=\"#1F3D2B\"/><text x=\"26\" y=\"125.0\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#ffffff\" text-anchor=\"middle\">1</text>\n<text x=\"44.0\" y=\"144.0\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#17201A\" text-anchor=\"start\">Start behind</text>\n<g transform=\"translate(210.0 166.0) scale(1.0)\"><ellipse cx=\"0\" cy=\"0\" rx=\"13\" ry=\"5\" fill=\"#17201A\"/><circle cx=\"13\" cy=\"-2\" r=\"4\" fill=\"#17201A\"/><path d=\"M17 -2 l6 1 l-6 2 Z\" fill=\"#17201A\"/><path d=\"M-4 -2 L4 -16 L8 -2 Z\" fill=\"#17201A\"/><path d=\"M-13 0 l-6 -3 l0 6 Z\" fill=\"#17201A\"/></g>\n<circle cx=\"214\" cy=\"164\" r=\"7\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#1F3D2B\" stroke-width=\"3\"/>\n<circle cx=\"26\" cy=\"164\" r=\"11\" fill=\"#1F3D2B\"/><text x=\"26\" y=\"169.0\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#ffffff\" text-anchor=\"middle\">2</text>\n<text x=\"44.0\" y=\"188.0\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#17201A\" text-anchor=\"start\">Catch up and pass</text>\n<g transform=\"translate(270.0 210.0) scale(1.0)\"><ellipse cx=\"0\" cy=\"0\" rx=\"13\" ry=\"5\" fill=\"#17201A\"/><circle cx=\"13\" cy=\"-2\" r=\"4\" fill=\"#17201A\"/><path d=\"M17 -2 l6 1 l-6 2 Z\" fill=\"#17201A\"/><path d=\"M-4 -2 L4 -16 L8 -2 Z\" fill=\"#17201A\"/><path d=\"M-13 0 l-6 -3 l0 6 Z\" fill=\"#17201A\"/></g>\n<circle cx=\"304\" cy=\"208\" r=\"7\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#FF6A13\" stroke-width=\"3\"/>\n<circle cx=\"26\" cy=\"208\" r=\"11\" fill=\"#FF6A13\"/><text x=\"26\" y=\"213.0\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#ffffff\" text-anchor=\"middle\">3</text>\n<text x=\"44.0\" y=\"232.0\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#FF6A13\" text-anchor=\"start\">Fire as you pass ahead</text>\n<text x=\"200.0\" y=\"290.0\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#1F3D2B\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Fast flushes: grouse.</text>\n</svg>\n</figure><ul><li>Start behind, swing faster, fire as you pass, keep swinging <span class=\"cert c-mid\" title=\"Certainty\">85%</span>.</li><li>Hunter education teaches it first. Good on fast grouse <span class=\"cert c-mid\" title=\"Certainty\">85%</span>.</li></ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>More: which one to learn</summary><ul><li>Pull away is the skeet shooter's favourite; maintained lead (also called sustained lead) suits long crossers; swing through suits fast flushes (70 to 85%, <a href=\"#/s/shotgun-skills/3\">Shotgun skills</a>).</li><li>In every method the gun keeps moving after the shot. Stopping it is the classic miss behind <span class=\"cert c-mid\" title=\"Certainty\">85%</span>.</li><li>My lean: learn swing through for grouse and pull away on clays for ducks. Pick one and stay with it a season (Tip).</li><li>A crossing duck at 30 m needs roughly 1 to 2 m of lead <span class=\"cert c-lo\" title=\"Certainty\">65%</span>. Do not measure it in the blind: learn the picture on clays <span class=\"cert c-lo\" title=\"Certainty\">70%</span>.</li></ul></details><a class=\"yt-card\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=lykha_EEBFQ\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><span class=\"yt-play\">▶</span><span class=\"yt-text\"><b>Shooting Tip: Three Different Leads</b><small>Three lead methods. Pick one and practise it.<br>Ducks Unlimited, YouTube, 1 min. Needs internet.</small></span></a>","<aside class=\"callout rule\" role=\"note\"><div class=\"callout-t\">Grandpa's rule (wisdom, not law)</div><p>Grandpa's rule (wisdom): Look at the beak, never the barrel. The gun goes where the eyes go.</p></aside><aside class=\"callout mistake\" role=\"note\"><div class=\"callout-t\">Common mistakes</div><ul><li>Lifting your head to watch the bird fall: the shot goes high.</li><li>Stopping the gun at the bang: the shot goes behind.</li><li>Aiming one eyed like a rifle.</li></ul></aside><aside class=\"callout field\" role=\"note\"><div class=\"callout-t\">Do this in the field</div><p>Three clay trips before the opener: one each for pull away, maintained lead and swing through. Keep the one that broke the most.</p></aside>","<ul><li>Hunter education and Ducks Unlimited via the app (70 to 85%). Browning manual <span class=\"cert c-hi\" title=\"Certainty\">95%</span>. Checked 2026-10-23.</li></ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>More: all sources</summary><ul><li><a href=\"https://www.hunter-ed.com/national/studyGuide/Shotgun-Shooting-Stance/201099_92899/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Hunter Ed: shotgun stance, shouldering, swing through and sustained lead</a>, via <a href=\"#/s/shotgun-skills\">Shotgun skills</a> <span class=\"cert c-mid\" title=\"Certainty\">85%</span></li><li>Ducks Unlimited shooting tips, via <a href=\"#/s/shotgun-skills\">Shotgun skills</a> (70 to 85%)</li><li><a href=\"https://www.browning.com/content/dam/browning/support/owners-manuals/2021/21-BFA-299_Citori%20OM_WEB.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Browning Citori owner's manual (2021)</a>: comb and rib alignment. Read directly 2026-10-23 <span class=\"cert c-hi\" title=\"Certainty\">95%</span></li></ul></details>"]